    "title": "酬樂天寄生衣",
    "poem": [
      "秋茅處處流痎瘧，夜鳥聲聲哭瘴雲。",
      "羸骨不勝纖細物，欲將文服卻還君。"
    ]
  },
  {
    "uid": "QTS_416_008_01",
    "volume": 416,
    "author": {
      "canonical": "元稹",
      "recorded": "元稹",
      "gender": "male",
      "period": "Middle Tang",
      "english_name": "Yuan Zhen",
